# Raspberry Pi 4 board-specific packages.
#
# rpi-boot ships the GPU firmware blobs (start4.elf/fixup4.dat/...)
# into /boot — the image stage stages them onto the esp from there.
# firmware-linux-brcm-rpi is the brcmfmac wifi + BT firmware (also
# listed in [firmware].packages). Deliberately NOT base-rpi: its
# Chimera-shaped config (single-root cmdline, /boot/config.txt
# tmpfiles, linux-version kernel.d hook) conflicts with the A/B
# PARTLABEL model — Crag generates its own config.txt
# (boards/rpi4/rpi/config.txt).
rpi-boot
firmware-linux-brcm-rpi
libubootenv-progs  # fw_printenv/fw_setenv: RAUC uboot backend flips BOOT_ORDER/BOOT_x_LEFT (AD-009) — first metal boot failed mark-good without it
